<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-economou-palate-ruguga-turing> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Economou et al. (2012) FGF10/FGF7-SHH activator-inhibitor Turing stripe mechanism at mammalian palatal growth zones (Mammalian secondary hard palate (Mus musculus E12.0-E15.5 & Equus caballus Rugae palatinae))",
        "Economou et al. (2012) FGF10/FGF7-SHH activator-inhibitor Turing stripe mechanism at mammalian palatal growth zones faithfully reproduces Mammalian secondary hard palate (Mus musculus E12.0-E15.5 & Equus caballus Rugae palatinae) morphology" ;
