        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/economou-palate-ruguga-turing-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2012-economou-palate-ruguga-turing.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Mammalian secondary hard palate (Mus musculus E12.0-E15.5 & Equus caballus Rugae palatinae) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 92.4/100, audit 2026-10-19-palate-ruguga-turing-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45d4150/2012-economou-palate-ruguga-turing.py> ;
