<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-economou-palate-ruguga-turing-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Economou et al. (2012) FGF10/FGF7-SHH activator-inhibitor Turing stripe mechanism at mammalian palatal growth zones — MorphoEval overall 92.4/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2012-economou-palate-ruguga-turing.py` (92.4/100, up +36.2 from 56.2/100 in Pass 1). The remediated script implements Economou et al.'s (2012) mesenchymal FGF10/FGF7 activator + epithelial SHH inhibitor reaction-diffusion PDE operating at the palatal ruga-8 anterior growth zone, exact Jacobian and dispersion analysis (lambda_c = 3.2221, q_c = 1.9500, Delta(q_c) = -11.64), 9-stage sequential intercalation (`R8 -> R1 -> R2 -> R3 -> R4 -> R5 -> R6 -> R7 -> R7b`, r = 1.0000, RMSE = 0.0023), in-phase FGF-SHH stripe colocalization (r = +0.9880), 2D surgical incision experiments (sagittal cut preserving 9 parallel stripes vs coronal cut across the ruga-8 growth zone elevating bifurcation/spot index 2.9x to 0.4695), cyclopamine SHH blockade, Spry2-/-;Spry4+/- + exogenous FGF10 bead hyperactivation (12 rugae), equal-diffusion negative control (0 rugae), and DoG ridge segmentation of 15 left-shelf and 16 right-shelf transverse palatal rugae in the vendored mammalian hard palate specimen. Overall 92.4/100 (faithfulness 92.3, reproducibility 92.6); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 45d4150; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 91, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 93, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 91. Output judged: docs/media/palate_ruguga_turing_comparison.png: rendered output of 2012-economou-palate-ruguga-turing.py at 45d4150, image/png, 892012 B, 2202×1464 px, artifact_sha256 160aa86a4bcc0206a11b1578d108b8818ba0b95fe2f48898a70fa448ec3bcce7 (sha256 160aa86a4bcc0206a11b1578d108b8818ba0b95fe2f48898a70fa448ec3bcce7), spec_fingerprint 2d8b918612b8f3a25ba7f27439207d03bf556187e2f521ce737d04a76d0c39ef. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 2d8b918612b8f3a25ba7f27439207d03bf556187e2f521ce737d04a76d0c39ef; artifact_sha256: 160aa86a4bcc0206a11b1578d108b8818ba0b95fe2f48898a70fa448ec3bcce7; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/palate_ruguga_turing/palate_rugae_specimen.jpg=a38f6c053ffe9048..., datasets/palate_ruguga_turing/palate_ruguga_turing_reference.json=e76e670dd50c86fe..., datasets/palate_ruguga_turing/paper_citations.bib=fd020997fb3c2db0..., datasets/palate_ruguga_turing/scout_manifest.json=f0a345a5c9039e78...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-palate-ruguga-turing-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D epithelial-mesenchymal FGF-SHH reaction-diffusion sheet to finite-element mechanical epithelial thickening (placode invagination) to simulate 3D palatal ridge elevation." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.24e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-economou-palate-ruguga-turing-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Economou et al. (2012) FGF10/FGF7-SHH activator-inhibitor Turing stripe mechanism at mammalian palatal growth zones — Parameter expressivity: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates the 9-stage embryonic elongation trajectory (`E12.0` to `E15.5`, `R8 -> R1..R7b`, L198-246), simulates 6 distinct surgical and pharmacological regimes in 2D (intact WT, sagittal cut, coronal cut across ruga-8 growth zone, cyclopamine SHH blockade, Spry2/4 + FGF10 bead hyperactivation, and equal-diffusion D_A=D_H ablation control, L483-526), and exposes CLI flags `--a11`, `--a12`, `--a21`, `--a22`, `--D-ratio`, `--growth-rate`, `--seed`, `--skip-gif`, and `--self-test` (L838-870)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
